<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Zanaki 1 Timothy</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Enyaarubha yo okutaanga ya Pauro ku Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Enyaarubha yo okutaanga ya Pauro ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo</para>
  <para style="imt">Obhutaangiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Enyaarubha yino yakaamirwe na Pauro. Akamukaamira omuutu wuno yaari akubhirikirwa Timoteo, wuno akatuuribhwa kwe enzira ye emirimo gya Pauro, nikyo kikoriri Pauro aramubhirikira Timoteo kubha, omwaana waaye we eheene mubhwiikirirya. Timoteo ahaageendania na Pauro mumirimo myaaru gyo okurwaaza Amangʼana Amazomu iguru wa Yeesu Krisito (<char style="xt">rora <ref loc="ACT 17:14-15">Amahokya ga Abheega 17:14-15</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:5">18:5</ref></char>). Pauro hano yaari akyaari kukaama enyaarubha yino, akamuha Timoteo emirimo gyo okwiimeererera abhiikirirya mumugye gwa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Obhugirirye bhwa Pauro okukaama enyaarubha yino, bhwaari ni kumubhuurira Timoteo kyeego ekweenderwa okusora no okweegya abhakaruka bhe ekanisa na abhasakirya. Pauro akeenda kubha, abhakaruka bhabhe abhaheene, bheegye obhuheene ne eteemo nzomu kubhiikirirya. Kweeki aramusabha ewe hamwe na abhiikirirya bhoosi bhabhe, bharasabhira abhaatu bhoosi, kumasabhi ga maanga goosi. Ekitabhu kino kireegya abhiimeerereri bha amakanisa bhabhe na amanaga okwaanga ameegyo goosi go orurimi. Kweeki kina amaragiriryo maaru gano gakunagya kusakirya abhiimeerereri bha makanisa eziisiku zino okukaangata amakanisa gaabhu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Obhukeerya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Enyaarubha yino nikaamiri enye Pauro, omweega wa Krisito Yeesu. Nitumirwe kubha omweega wa Krisito Yeesu kwo obhuswaagyo bhwa Taatabhugya Omutuurya weetu, na Krisito Yeesu niwe eriisigo ryeetu. <verse eid="1TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Nirakukaamira awe Timoteo, omwaana waane we eheene mubhwiikirirya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Orubhaango, ebhigoongi no omureembe okurwa ku Taatabhugya Taata, na ku Krisito Yeesu Omukuru weetu, bhibhe naawe.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhurekya iguru wa ameegyo go orurimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Hano natanwiiri kugya mumugye gwa Makedonia, nikakusabha wiikare mumugye gwa Efeso, nikakukumiirirya okubha obharekye abhaatu bhano bhakweegya ameegyo go orurimi. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Obharekye bhatige okugwaatirira amagano gano gatana bhweera, no okwiinyaakya no obhuzaabhi bhwa amariina ga bhazaazi gano gatana obhuteero. Amangʼana gayo goosi garakora obhuhakani, gatakusakirya abhaatu okumwiikirirya Taatabhugya, kyeego gari amiiseego gaaye go obhutuurya bhuno bhukutuukana no obhwiikirirya. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Obhugirirye bhwe eriiragiriro riyo ni kubha, abhiikirirya bhaseegane kwo obhuseegi bhwe eheene, kumitima mizomu no obhwiikirirya bhwe eheene. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Nawe abheegya abhaandi bhatigiri gayo, bhiikyooriri, bharagaamba amangʼana gano gatana bhweera. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Bhareenda bhabhe abheegya bhe emigiro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abheegya bhe emigiro</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora amangʼana gano mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> gya Musa, yiingabha gano bhakubhuga no okukumiirirya, bhatagamenyiri.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Nawe etwe tumenyiri kubha, emigiro gya Musa ni mizomu, kyeego omuutu araagituniirire kyeego ekweenderwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Kweeki, tureenderwa kumenya kubha, emigiro gitatuurirwe kubhe eheene, nawe kubhano bhakusarya emigiro na bhano bhakwaanga, kubhano bhatakumuseengera Taatabhugya na abhasarya. Na gyatuurirwe kubhano bhatakumwiigwa Taatabhugya na abhabhi, kubhano bhakwiita bhawiise na bhanina waabhu, na kubhiiti bha abhaatu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>kubhaseebheeti na bhano bhakuhiindira na abhasubhe abharikyaabhu kya abhakari, kubhano bhakuratira abhaatu no okubhagurya mubhutumwa, abhabheehi, na kubhano bhakwiirahira kwo orurimi. Emigiro gituurirwe kumangʼana goosi gano gatakweendana na ameegyo go obhuhoru. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Ameegyo gayo, garabhoneka mu Mangʼana Amazomu, gano gakweerekya obhuguungo bhwa Taatabhugya murubhaango rwoosi. Amangʼana gayo nigo nikahaabhwa na Taatabhugya nibharwaazire.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omureembe gwa Yeesu Krisito ku Pauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Nirabhuga, “Ozomirye, Krisito Yeesu Omukuru weetu.” Ewe akaaniha amanaga, kwo okubha akaanimenya ni muheene no okunisora nibhe omuhokya waaye. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Na yiingabha kubhutaangiro hayo, nikamutuka no okunyaakya abhaatu bhaaye, niari omuzabhuri, nawe ewe akaanirorera ebhigoongi. Akakora ego, kwe ekigirirye niari nirakora gayo kwo obhugeege na nitaari no obhwiikirirya. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Eheene Omukuru weetu Krisito Yeesu akaanitweera ebhite bhukongʼu, kweeki akaaniha obhwiikirirya no obhuseegi kwo okugwaatana neewe.<verse eid="1TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Engʼana yino ni ye eheene, na ereenderwa okwiikiriribhwa kubha, “Krisito Yeesu akaaza mukyaaro, okubha atuurye bhe ebhibhi.” Na gati we ebhibhi bhayo, enye neenye nikoriri ebhibhi kukira bhoosi. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Nawe kwe ekigirirye kiyo, Yeesu Krisito akaanirorera ebhigoongi! Akaanierekya okwiikongʼeererya kwaaye kweenye we ebhibhi kukira bhoosi, okubha nibhe ekireengyo kubharya bharaamwiikirirye no okusuungʼaana obhuhoru bhwa kirakeego. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Ambe, Taatabhugya niwe omutemi wuno atana obhuteero, atakukwa, naabhe atakurorekana, na niwe omweene. Ewe asuungʼaane obhusuuku no obhuguungo kirakeego na kirakeego. Gabhe ego.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauro aramuswaagya Timoteo okugwaatirira amaragiriro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Timoteo omwaana waane, nirakuha amaragiriro gano, kuriingʼaana na amangʼana go obhurooti gano gaagaambirwe iguru waazo. Amangʼana gayo gakusakirye kye ekigwaato mwiihi rya Taatabhugya izomu. <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Ogwaatirire obhwiikirirya no omutima muzomu. Abhaatu abhaandi bharegiri okukora garya bhamenyiri kubha ni heene, riyo rikoriri bhatige obhwiikirirya bhwaabhu. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Mubhaatu bhayo arimu Himenayo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="2TI 2:17-18">2 Timoteo 2:17-18</ref>.</char></note> na Arekizanda. Bhayo nibhatigiiri Seetaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20b </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obhugazuro bhwa </char><char style="fk" closed="false">nibhatigiiri Seetaani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni kubha Pauro akabhaanga okugeenderera kugwaatana hamwe na abhiikirirya mukanisa.</char></note> okubha bheege, bhatige kumutuka Taatabhugya.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo iguru yo obhusabhi mumakanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Ambe, obhweemero bhwa goosi, nirakusabha awe hamwe na abhiikirirya bhoosi mubhe murasabhira abhaatu bhoosi, kumasabhi ga maanga goosi. Kweeki, mubhe muramubhuurira Taatabhugya “Ozomirye” kwiiguru ya abhaatu bhoosi. <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Mureenderwa kubhasabhira abhatemi na abhaandi bhoosi bho obhukaangati, okubha twiikare kwo omureembe, tumutuniirire Taatabhugya no okubha ne eteemwa nzomu. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Eriingʼana rino ni zomu, kweeki riramuzomera Taatabhugya Omutuurya weetu. <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>Ewe areenda abhaatu bhoosi bhatuuribhwe, no okumenya obhuheene. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Tumenyiri kubha gayo ni go obhuheene, kwo okubha ariho Taatabhugya wumwe ego, no omuutu wumwe wuno okwiigwaania abhaatu na Taatabhugya, neewe ni Krisito Yeesu. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>Ewe akaruusya obhwiikari bhwaaye omweene, okubha abhatuurye abhaatu bhoosi. Bhuno nibhwo obhweerekenio bhuno Taatabhugya akatuha, kwiibhaga rino yateeriho. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Na kwe ekigirirye kiyo, enye nikatuurwa kubha omweega nigeende okurwaaza no okweegya bharya bhatari Abhayahudi amangʼana go obhwiikirirya no obhuheene. Niragaamba ge eheene, nitakugaamba orurimi.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Kweego, ahagiro hoosi hano mukwiikumania kusabha, ndeenda abhasubhe bhagororokye amabhoko iguru okusabha. Bhakore ego kwa amiiseego mazomu, bhasabhe bhatana obhuhaari naabhe kuhakana. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Kweego ndeenda abhakari bhiibhoohe kyeego ekweenderwa, bhabhe ne eteemo nzomu na kusuuhu. Bhataseega kungʼarira kwo okusuka eziinzweeri,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Okusuka eziinzweeri, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ku Kizanaki bhaari bharabhuga, okuruka kaswa.</char></note> kasi kwo okwiibhoha ebhigiro bhye ezahaabu na bhino bhikubharyabharya, kasi eziingibho zyo obhuguri bhukuru. <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Nawe bhabhe ne eteemo nzomu, kyeego bhakweenderwa abhakari bhano bhiikiriirye kumuseengera Taatabhugya. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Hano abhakari bhakubha bhareega, bhabhe abhiitegeereri na abhiigwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Nitakubhaha abhakari omweeya gwo okweegya naabhe okukaangata abhasubhe, nawe bhabhe abhiitegeereri. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Niragaambeego, kwo okubha Taatabhugya akabhuumba Adaamu kubhweemero, okumara Haawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Naabhe Adaamu ataangʼeenereerwe, nawe omukari niwe akangʼeenererwa, akasarya obhuswaagyo bhwa Taatabhugya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Obhweemero 3:1-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Nawe abhakari bharasuungʼaana obhutuurya kwe enzira yo okwiibhura abhaana, kyeego bhakugeenderera kwiikara mubhwiikirirya, obhuseegi, obhuhoreeru no okubha na kusuuhu.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Omukumo gwa abhiimeerereri bhe ekanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Eriingʼana rino ni rye eheene, “Omuutu wuno areenda emirimo gyo okubha omwiimeerereri we ekanisa, wuyo yiigoombiri emirimo emizomu.” <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Ambe, omwiimeerereri we ekanisa, abhe omuutu wuno atakusororibhwa. Abhe no omukari wumwe ego, abhe na kusuuhu, kweeki abhe wa amangʼeeni, omuutu wuno akusuukwa, musaambaaruku, no omuutu wuno amenyiri okweegya. <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>Atabha omunywi omuraara, atabha omurwaani, abhe munyoohu wuno aseegiri omureembe. Kweeki atabha wuno aseegiri eziimbirya. <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>Abhe omwiimeerereri omuzomu we enyuumba yaaye, bhano bhamenyiri okweegya abhaana eteemwa yo okwiigwa no obhusuuku. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Eraabhe omuutu aratamwa okwiimeererera enyuumba yaaye omweene, aranagyabhwi okuriibha abhiikirirya mukanisa ya Taatabhugya? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Kweeki, atabha omwiikirirya omuhya, ataaza okwiizuungya. Okwiizuungya kuyo kuramukora atinirwe ekiina kyeego Seetaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seetaani</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora engʼana yino mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> akatinirwa ekiina. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Nawe, abhe omuutu wuno akugaambwa bhuzomu naabhe na abhaatu bhano bhatari Abhakrisito, okubha ataaza kubha na amasoro no okutiimbwa mukitiimbo kya Seetaani.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omukumo gwa abhasakirya bhe ekanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Abhasakirya bhe ekanisa nabho, bhabhe ne eteemwa nzomu, bhatabha abhabheehi, bhatabha abhanywi abharaara, bhatabha bhano bhaseegiri eziimbirya. <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>Nawe, bhabhe abhaatu bhano bhakugwaatirira obhuheene bhwo obhwiikirirya bhweetu kwo omutima muzomu. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Bhayo nabho, bhasakibhwe obhutaangiro. Na bharirorekana kubha bhatana amasoro, niho bhakore emirimo giyo. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Kweego, abhakari bhaabhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abhakari bhaabhu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, obhugazuro obhuundi bhuratura kubha, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">abhakari abhasakirya.</char></note> bhabhe bhe eteemo nzomu, bhatabha abhamoonyi, bhabhe na kusuuhu, bhabhe abhaheene mumangʼana goosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Abhasakirya bhabhe no omukari wumwe wumwe, na bhabhe bhariimeererera bhuzomu abhaana bhaabhu na abhaandi bhano bhari munyuumba yaabhu. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Bharya bhano bhakukora emirimo gyo obhusakirya bhuzomu, bharabha bharasuukwa. Hayo bharaabhe no obhukaari bhwaaru bhwo kuraarika amangʼana go obhwiikirirya bhwaabhu mu Krisito Yeesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhuheene bhwo obhwiikirirya bhweetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Nirakukaamira amangʼana gayo, yiingabha niriisiga okuuza owaazo bhwaangu hano. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Nawe nirikeezera, omenye gano bhakweenderwa abhaatu okukora munyuumba ya Taatabhugya. Abhaatu bhayo nibho ekanisa ya Taatabhugya wuno ari muhoru, ne ekanisa niyo etimu no obhurusa bhwo obhuheene. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Obhuheene bhuno Taatabhugya yeerekirye ni bhwo okuruguurya, neebhwo ni bhuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Krisito akiiyeerekya kwo omubhiri gwaaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akeerekibhwa ne Ekoro kubha omuheene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akarorekana kubhamaraika,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bhamaraika</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora engʼana </char><char style="it">maraika</char> mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akarwaaza mubhyaaro bhyoosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akiikiriribhwa na abhaatu mukyaaro kyoosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akagegwa okugya iguru mubhuguungo.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Abheegya bho orurimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Bhoono, Ekoro Muhoreeru aragaamba atakubhisa kubha, muziisiku zyo obhuteero, abhaandi bharaaza okutiga obhwiikirirya bhwe eheene, no okutuniirira eziikoro zyo obhungʼeenererya, na ameegyo ga amasaambwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Ameegyo gayo, gareegibhwa na bho orurimi, kweeki bho orurimi bhano emitima gyaabhu gikuuri kyeego gyookiibhwe kwe ekyooma kyo omuriro. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Bhayo bharabharekya abhaandi kubha bhatige okukweera, kasi kurya ebhyaakurya ebhiindi. Nawe Taatabhugya akabhibhuumba okubha bhisuungʼaanwe kwo okuzyomya na abhiikirirya, kwo okubha bhamenyiri obhuheene. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Ebhigiro bhyoosi bhya Taatabhugya ni bhizomu, naabhe kitariho kyo okwaangwa. Bhyoosi bhisuungʼaanwe kwo okuzyomya, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>kwo okubha eriingʼana rya Taatabhugya na amasabhi geetu, garabhikora ebhigiro bhiyo bhyeeribhwe.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omubhagati omuzomu wa Yeesu Krisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Oraabhahe abhahiiri bheetu ameegyo gano, hayo niho oraabhe omuhokya omuzomu wa Krisito Yeesu. Kweeki orabha okiiniiri bhuzomu mubhuheene bhwo obhwiikirirya bhweetu na mumeegyo amazomu gano ogatuniiriiri. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Otigane na amagano ga abhaatu bhe ekare gano gatari ge enyaangi gano gatana bhweera, nawe wiinarye okwiikara kyeego Taatabhugya akweenda. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Emenyekeeni kubha, “Okunarya omubhiri okubhona amanaga, kuno obhweera hasuuhu. Nawe, wiinarye okwiikara kyeego Taatabhugya akweenda, bhuriho obhweera bhwa maanga goosi, kwo okubha bhuratuha obhurage bhwo okubhona obhuhoru bhwa bhoono na bhuno bhukuuza.” <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Engʼana yiyo ni ye eheene, abhaatu bhareenderwa bhasuungʼaane. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Riyo niryo riragirya turakora omukya, kwo okubha turamwiisigira Taatabhugya wuno ari muhoru, Omutuurya wa abhaatu bhoosi, kiindi bhano bhakwiikirirya.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Amangʼana gayo, ogeegye no okugaswaagya. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Omuutu wowoosi atakuzeera awe kwo okubha okyaari mumura, nawe okore omukya obhe ekireengyo kya abhiikirirya mubhugaambi, muteemo, na mubhuseegi, mubhwiikirirya na kwe eheene. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Okore omukya kusomera abhaatu Amakaamo Amahoreeru, orwaaze no okweegya, tee hano niraaze eyo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Otatiga kuhokeerya obhuturo bhuno Taatabhugya akuheeri kuhitira amangʼana go obhurooti, eriibhaga okatuurirwa amabhoko na abhakaruka bhe ekanisa. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ogwaatirire amangʼana gayo, okubha abhaatu bhoosi bharore omukya gwaazo mubhwiikari bhwaazo. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Wiiriibhe eteemo yaazo na ameegyo gaazo, no ogeenderere okukora ego. Hano okukora gayo oriituurya awe omweene na bhano bhakukwiitegeerera.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Obhuswaagyo kubhiikirirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Otabhiiyogya abhakaruka, nawe obhatoongere kyeego okutoongera wuuso weenyu. Abhamura obhatoongere kyeego abhahiiri bhaazo, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>abhakiikuru kyeego nyoko weenyu, na abhaakya obhakorere kwe ekoro nzomu kyeego abhasubhaati bheenyu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Obhasuuke abhatuumba bhano bhatana wo okubhasakirya. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Nawe, eraabhe omutuumba wowoosi ana abhaana kasi abhazukuru, bhayo bheege okusakirya abhahiiri bhaabhu. Hano bhakukora ego, niho bharariha abhiibhuri bhaabhu amazomu gano bhabhakoreeri. Ego niigo Taatabhugya akweenda. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Omutuumba wuno atana muutu wo okumusakirya, wuyo aramwiisiga Taatabhugya, aramuseengera no okumusabha Taatabhugya amusakirye obhutiku no omwiisi. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Nawe omutuumba wuno akuseega enaamba ye ekyaaro, wuyo akuuri yiingabha ararorekana muhoru. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Amangʼana gayo, obhabhuurire abhiikirirya, okubha bhataaza kubha na amasoro. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Nawe omuutu wowoosi wuno atakusakirya abhaatu bhaaye, kiindi bha munyuumba yaaye, wuyo arabha atigiri obhwiikirirya, kweeki abheeri mubhiihu kukira omuutu wuno atari mwiikirirya.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Omutuumba ariikiriribhwa okubharwa mubhatuumba, eraabhe ahikirye emyaaka kweemera miroongo esaasabha (60), kweeki yaari mukari wo omusubhe wumwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Abhe ano omukumo muzomu kumahokya gaaye. Abhe areriri abhaana bhaaye bhuzomu, abhe araginihya abhagini, abhe arabhiisaabhya abhahoreeru amaguru gaabhu, abhe arabhasakirya bhano bhakunyaakibhwa, kweeki abhe ariiruusya na yiibhanwiiri okukora amahokya amazomu.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Nawe, abhakari abhatuumba, otabhaha omweeya kusikira mubhubharwa, kwo okubha enaamba yo omubhiri erabhatama kukira okwiiruusya ku Krisito, hayo bhareenda okukweerwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Kwo okukora ego, bharabha bhatiniirwe ekiina, kwo okubha bhatigiri obhurage bhwaabhu ku Krisito bhwo okusaaga bhakyaari kukweerwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Abhatuumba kya bhayo, bhanariri eteemo yo obhutobhu, bharageendageenda muziinyuumba zya abhaatu. Kweeki, bharabha abhagwaatania no okwiisikirya mumangʼana ga abhaandi, eno bharabhuga amangʼana gano gatakweenderwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Bhoono, enye ndeenda abhatuumba abhasubhaati, bhabhe bharakweerwa, bhiibhure abhaana no okutuga eziinyuumba zyaabhu, okubha abhabhisa bheetu bhatige okutugaamba bhubhi. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Rora kubha abhatuumba abhasubhaati abhaandi bhamariri okubhura no okumutuniirira Seetaani.<verse eid="1TI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Kyo omukari omwiikirirya ana abhatuumba mubhahiiri bhaaye, abhasakirye. Akore ego, okubha ekanisa etigwe kutamirwa, niho ekanisa erabha no omweeya gwo okusakirya abhatuumba abhaandi bhano bhatana obhusakirya.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Abhakaruka bhe ekanisa bhano bhakwiimeererera ekanisa bhuzomu, bhasuukwe no okukorerwa amazomu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bhasuukwe no okukorerwa amazomu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ku Kiyunaani ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bhasuukwe maanga abhiri.</char></note> kiindi bhano bhakwiiruusya okurwaaza no okweegya engʼana ya Taatabhugya. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Niragaamba ego, kwo okubha ekaamirwe mu Makaamo Amahoreeru, “Engʼoombe hano ekuhuura engano, otayibhoha omunwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="DEU 25:4">Obhuhiiti bhwe Emigiro 25:4</ref>.</char></note> Kweeki ekaamirwe, “Omuhokya wuyo woosi areenderwa ahaabhwe amariho gaaye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Ruuka 10:7</ref>.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="oxen threshing grain" file="hk00096c.tif" size="col" loc="1Tim 5:18" copy="Horace Knowles © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society" ref="5:18">Eziingʼoombe zirahuura engano</figure><verse eid="1TI 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Otiikirirya amasemo iguru yo omukaruka we ekanisa, otana obhumenyeekererya bhwa abhaatu bhabhiri kasi bhatatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Obhuhiiti bhwe Emigiro 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Nawe abhakaruka bhe ekanisa bhano bhakugeenderera okukora amabhi, obharekye embere wa bhoosi, okubha abhaandi bhayo bhoobhohe.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhurekya ku Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Nirakuswaagya embere wa Taatabhugya, ne embere ya Krisito Yeesu na bhamaraika abhasorwa kubha, ogwaatirire gayo, otatina ekiina kwa bhwaangu kasi okuseega orubhaara rumwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Otiikirirya kwa bhwaangu kumutuurira omuutu amabhoko akore emirimo gyo Omukuru, kwo okubha orimutuurira omuutu omubhi amabhoko, awe orabha wiisaangirye mubhubhi bhwaaye. Awe wiiriihe, okubha osaage kubha omuheene.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Kweemera bhoono, awe otanywa amaanzi ageene, nawe obhe oranywa na amaanzi go omuzabibu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Amaanzi go omuzabibu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora amangʼana gano mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> masuuhu kwiiguru yo obhurweeri bhwaazo bhwe enda na amarweeri agaandi gano gakukunyaakya.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Abhaatu abhaandi, ebhibhi bhyaabhu bhirarorekana kubhweero, naabhe bhakyaari kutinirwa ekiina. Nawe abhaatu abhaandi, ebhibhi bhyaabhu bhiibhisiri, bhirarorekana ibhaga riindi. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Egoego, amahokya amazomu gararorekana kubhweero. Na garya giibhisiri, garabha kubhweero.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s">Obhuswaagyo kubhabhagati abhiikirirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Abhagya bhoosi abhiikirirya, bhasuuke abhakuru bhaabhu, okubha eriina rya Taatabhugya na ameegyo geetu gatazeerwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Abhagya bhano abhakuru bhaabhu ni bhiikirirya, bhatabhazeera kwo okubha ebho ni bhahiiri. Bhareenderwa kubhahokeerya bhuzomu no okukira, kiindi kwo okubha bharabha bharabhasakirya abhiikirirya abharikyaabhu, kweeki ni bhaseegwa bhaabhu. Gayo obheegye no okurekya.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo go orurimi no obhuniibhi bhwe eheene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Bhariho abhaatu bhano bhakweegya ameegyo go orurimi. Bhareegya gano gatakwiikirirania na ameegyo go obhuheene bhwo Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito, kweeki gatakwiikirirania na ameegyo gano gakubhakaangata abhaatu okumutuniirira Taatabhugya. <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>Bhayo bhiizwiiri obhwiizuungya, kweeki bhatamenyiri riyo ryoosi. Abhaatu bhayo bhariibhaamba haka zino zitana obhweera iguru ye ehingʼana hisuuhu. Mugayo gurarweeramu omugono, eriiyoge, amatuki, amiiseego mabhiihu, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>kweeki eziisiku zyoosi garasarya obhwiigwaani. Abhaatu bhayo bhasarikiri obhwoongo, bhatana obhuheene. Bhariiseega kubha okumutuniirira Taatabhugya niyo enzira yo okubhona obhuniibhi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Eheene, okumutuniirira Taatabhugya no okwiiswa ne ebhigiro bhino anabhyo, kuramukora omuutu abhone obhweera bhukongʼu, <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>kwo okubha mukyaaro muno, tutiiziri na kyokyoosi, naabhe tutakugya na kyokyoosi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Ambe, eraabhe tune ebhyaakurya na bhyo okwiibhoha, twiiswe nabhyo. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Nawe bhano bhakweenda obhuniibhi, bharagweera mubhitiika, no okutiimbwa mubhitiimbo, na munaamba nzaru ye ekigeege. Eziinaamba ziyo zirabhasarya tee bhasike, <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>kwo okubha okuseega bhukongʼu eziimbirya nikwo obhweemero bhwo obhubhi bhwaaru. Abhaandi bhaseegiri obhuniibhi, bhangʼeenereerwe, bhatigiri obhwiikirirya, bhoono bhariireetera obhururu bhwaaru no okunyaaka mukoro.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhurekya ku Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Nawe awe, omuutu wa Taatabhugya, ogaryaare gayo. Otuniirire obhuheene, obhusuuku bhwa Taatabhugya, obhwiikirirya, obhuseegi, obhwiikongʼeererya no obhunyoohu. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Orwaane eriihi izomu ryo obhwiikirirya, ogwaate obhuhoru bhwa kirakeego. Obhuhoru bhuyo, nibhwe okabhirikirirwa hano okiikirirya obhwiikirirya bhwaazo embere wa abhamenyeekererya bhaaru. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Nirakukumiirirya embere wa Taatabhugya wuno akubhiha obhuhoru ebhigiro bhyoosi, ne embere ya Krisito Yeesu wuno yaruusirye obhumenyeekererya bhwe eheene embere wa Pontio Pirato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>ogwaatirire obhuswaagyo bhuyo kwo okugiigwa no okutama okutitiikana, tee hano Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito araaze. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Okuuza kwaaye kuraabhe eriibhaga hano Taatabhugya yeendiri. Taatabhugya niwe araguungibhwa, ewe omweene niwe Omukaangati, niwe Omutemi wa abhatemi bhoosi, no Omukuru wa abhakuru bhoosi. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Ewe omweene niwe atakukwa, yiikeeri mubhweero bhuno omuutu atakunagya kubhwiisukiirira. Kweeki atariho omuutu wuno amuruuzi, naabhe wuno akunagya kumurora. Obhusuuku no obhunagya bhubhe bhwaaye, kirakeego. Gabhe ego.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Obhabhuurire abhaniibhi bhatige okwiiguungya, naabhe okwiisiga obhuniibhi bhwaabhu bhwe ekyaaro kino, bhuno ni bhwi ibhaga iguhi. Nawe bhamwiisige Taatabhugya wuno akutuha ebhigiro bhyoosi kwo obhusaambaaruku bhwaaye, okubha tubhihokeerye kwo obhuzomererwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Kweeki obhabhuurire bhakore amazomu, niho bhabhe abhaniibhi mumahokya amazomu. Bhabhe bhararuusya ebhigiro no okwiisaangya hamwe na abhaandi kubhigiro bhyaabhu. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Kwo okukora ego, bhariituurira ekibhuumbiko kyo obhurusa obhugumiru kuziisiku zino zikuuza, okubha bhasuungʼaane obhuhoru bhwe eheene.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Weyaa Timoteo, gwaatirira bhuzomu obhuheene bhuno oheerwe. Otige kwiisikirya mumangʼana gano gatari ge enyaangi na gatana obhugazuro bhwobhwoosi. Kweeki otiisikirya mubhuhakani bhwe ekigeege, gano abhaatu abhaandi bhariisiga kubha amangʼeeni. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Abhaatu abhaandi bhano bhagwaatiriri gayo, bhatigiri obhwiikirirya bhwaabhu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Orubhaango gubhe hamwe neemwe.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
